[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0010","text":"来，这个……\n辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0020","text":"……谢谢，那我收下了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0030","text":"……有柠檬"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0040","text":"很清爽吧？\n听说疲劳的身体适合吃柠檬"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0050","text":"以前，也有过这样的事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0060","text":"我吃了用蜂蜜腌的柠檬\n在练习室里"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0070","text":"————啊啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0080","text":"……哈哈哈\n好像是日花之前迷上过一阵子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0090","text":"——是吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0100","text":"写着“慰问品”的\n行李旁边放着一个带冰袋的容器——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0110","text":"不知怎的，那天就伸手拿了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0120","text":"……那个，真的很好吃"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0130","text":"听叶月说，她牺牲了好几个柠檬呢\n太薄了、太厚了……这样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0140","text":"（接上）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0150","text":"…………\n原来那种东西，是手工做的啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0122","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0160","text":"————…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_04_0170","text":"————多谢款待"}]
